# Coventry, Smithville, Greene, Bainbridge, Afton, Rockdale). Region scho drawn at random by tools/choose.py --state ny,
# which offered New Berlin, Owego and Windsor. A second pass over the county after scho_wopf (November 19), adding only
# what that batch and the rest of the Atlas lack. Sources opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py,
# the Chenango County Register list and the articles on each listing), HMdb marker pages and nearby lists (tools/page.py),
# and the Big Red Door Episcopal churches' visit page. Every Register form tried on NPGallery was a placeholder.
